WEBVTT

00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:02.989
They leave you in the moment
feeling more energized

00:26:03.013 --> 00:26:05.526
or a greater sense of vitality.

00:26:05.550 --> 00:26:10.238
And similarly, the opposite of that,
a low-quality connection,

00:26:10.262 --> 00:26:14.586
is one where you actually in the moment
feel de-energized or depleted.

00:26:14.610 --> 00:26:17.279
I often think of a wilted flower,

00:26:17.303 --> 00:26:22.726
you know, that just starts to droop
after that interaction,

00:26:22.750 --> 00:26:26.176
AG: Low-quality connections
are like the Dementors in "Harry Potter."

00:26:26.200 --> 00:26:29.313
They suck the life out of work
and reduce our performance.